<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26709" root="طس" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسٌّ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّةٌ</span></b>  (S, M, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَّةٌ</span></b>  (M, K)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسْتٌ</span>, (S, K,) which is expl. in its proper
place: (TA:) [see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طست</span>: or] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّةٌ</span> is the
original of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسْتٌ</span>: (Lth, TA:) the pl. (of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسٌّ</span>,
M) is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطْسَاسٌ</span> [a pl. of pauc.] (M) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُسُوسٌ</span>
(S, M, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسِيسٌ</span> (M, K) [or rather this is a
quasi-pl. n.] and (of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَّةٌ</span>, M) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَاسٌ</span>
and [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّةٌ</span> also] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّاتٌ</span>, (S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَّةٌ</span> may
also have for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَسٌ</span>, accord. to rule.
(M.) The dim. [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسٌّ</span>] is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُسَيْسٌ</span>; (S in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طست</span>;) and [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَسَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِسَّةٌ</span>,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُسَيْسَةٌ</span>. (IKt
and Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طست</span>.)

